---
import BaseLayout from "../../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import MetaPill from "../../../components/ui/MetaPill.astro";
import registry from "../../../data/phase-85-housing-shelter-land-use-place-stability-registry.json";

const delivery = registry.housing_need_supply_delivery_habitability_dossiers;
const tenure = registry.tenure_affordability_public_social_community_housing_ledgers;
const stability = registry.homelessness_shelter_supportive_housing_displacement_registers;
const place = registry.retrofit_climate_disaster_reconstruction_place_stability_ledgers;
---

<BaseLayout title="Housing, Shelter And Place Stability | FTFN" description="Thirty-two inactive housing-delivery, tenure, affordability, shelter, displacement, retrofit, reconstruction, and place-stability records.">
  <section class="page-section hero" data-housing-place-stability-registry><div class="hero__copy"><div class="eyebrow">FTFN / Housing And Place</div><h1 class="page-title">Approved units are not delivered homes, and a shelter bed is not stable housing.</h1><p class="lede">Phase 85 traces whether people receive safe, accessible, affordable, secure homes and can remain in or return to functioning communities through ordinary change, climate stress, displacement, disaster, retrofit, and reconstruction.</p><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label="8 inactive delivery dossiers" tone="possibility" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive tenure ledgers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive stability registers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive place ledgers" /><MetaPill label="0 housing decisions" tone="review" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Need, Supply, Delivery And Habitability</div><h2>Eight delivery dossiers remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/housing-need-supply-delivery-001/">Read the housing-delivery guide</a></div><div class="grid">{delivery.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.delivery_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/housing-place-stability/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Need, inventory, land, rights, approvals, infrastructure, finance, materials, workforce, starts, completions, occupancy, habitability, accessibility, neighborhood capacity, review, and receipts remain empty.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Tenure, Affordability And Community Housing</div><h2>Eight tenure ledgers contain no affordability finding.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/housing-affordability-cost-burden-001/">Read the affordability guide</a></div><div class="grid">{tenure.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.tenure_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/housing-place-stability/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.tenure_affordability_public_social_community_housing_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Tenure, ownership, provider governance, complete household cost, public and community housing, allocation, renter and owner security, maintenance, subsidy, preservation, participation, and continuity remain unassessed.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Homelessness, Shelter, Supportive Housing And Displacement</div><h2>Eight housing-stability registers remain inactive.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/homelessness-shelter-supportive-housing-001/">Read the shelter and supportive-housing guide</a></div><div class="source-list">{stability.map((record) => <article class="source-row"><div><h3><a href={'/evidence/housing-place-stability/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.homelessness_shelter_supportive_housing_displacement_register_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Homelessness need, shelter, outreach, rehousing, supportive housing, care coordination, dignity, accessibility, exits, returns, eviction prevention, encampment rights, displacement, relocation, and remedy remain unassessed.</p></div><MetaPill label={record.stability_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Retrofit, Climate, Disaster, Reconstruction And Place Stability</div><h2>Eight place-stability ledgers contain no recovery finding.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/reconstruction-right-to-return-place-stability-001/">Read the place-stability guide</a></div><div class="grid">{place.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><h3><a href={'/evidence/housing-place-stability/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.retrofit_climate_disaster_reconstruction_place_stability_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Condition, repair, retrofit, climate exposure, insurance, evacuation, interim housing, reconstruction, relocation, compensation, return, neighborhood recovery, land-value protection, adaptation, and audit remain inactive.</p><MetaPill label={record.place_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section briefing-band"><div class="briefing-band__copy"><div class="eyebrow">Public Contract</div><h2>Inspect the empty housing and place-stability state.</h2><p>The export publishes the complete control surface without approving land use; allocating housing or subsidy; placing anyone in shelter or services; issuing affordability, habitability, stability, relocation, return, reconstruction, or recovery findings; or creating a receipt, score, rank, or stage change.</p></div><article class="record-card"><a class="inline-link" href="/data/housing-shelter-land-use-place-stability.json">Housing and place-stability JSON</a></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
